{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "云云"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "只一妙體，故屬不二"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "附世假立，說身說土，由為\n物故，即屬用二"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "一法不二也，二義而二也。二即一法，故依正不二。故荊溪云：寂光法身，異而常一"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "機，空中也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "應，空中也"}
